// A platform as a track object: 210 m, 6 m wide, 0.76 m above the rail head, generated
// by tools/gen_platform.py. Its origin is the track-side edge at the platform's start,
// the body extends away from the track — so the default offset puts the edge 1.65 m
// from the track axis, on the left of increasing arc length.
//
// The model carries its own walkways (MODS.md, People): `wp_edge_*` is a footpath
// along the platform, `wa_middle_*` the waiting area behind the tactile strip. The
// people on them come with the object wherever a line places it.
(
    name: "Bahnsteig",
    model: "example/assets/platform.gltf",
    lateral_offset: -1.65,
    yaw_deg: 0.0,
    height: 0.0,
    tags: ["platform", "station"],
)
